{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-supervisor-s-team-call-names-who-asked-for-its-task",
  "title": "When several people take part, the review brief a Supervisor's delegate_workers call answers heads the task the supervisor wrote with who asked for it, by the conversation's label: Requested by Bob, in the delegating agent's words; the workers are handed the task as written, naming no one",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7",
    "§19.7.3",
    "§6.4"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-19.7-015",
    "RK-19.7-016",
    "RK-19.7-017",
    "RK-19.7-019",
    "RK-19.7-020",
    "RK-21.4-024"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/test_task_requester.py::TestATaskBlockNamesWhoAskedForIt::test_the_heading_names_the_asker_out_of_the_block, test_a_worker_s_own_input_carries_no_asker; core/_requester.py task_heading, orchestration/strategies/supervisor/results.py _format_supervisor_review, _inject_strategy.py (the tool runs under the supervisor's turn, current_tool_requester).",
